    "c2e52f58-8ed9-40bb-b498-dc1dcb196fe0": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "Our Goal",
        "title_size": 48,
        "title_width": 12,
        "heading_h1": false,
        "text": "<p>Our goal is to be among the top companies in the upholstery industry, the preferred brand for customers working with these materials. We are focused on anticipating and exceeding expectations, with an obsession for service and providing an exceptional customer experience.</p><p>We aspire to be recognized as an excellent company to work for, one that unleashes the full potential of its employees, attracts and retains talent, and builds a winning team. We want people to feel that they are part of something \"spectacular\" inspiring, and where it makes perfect sense to give their best while embracing the values of Monteiro Fabrics.</p>",
        "image_width": 60,
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "auto",
        "text_alignment": "center",
        "enlarge_text": false,
        "full_width": false,
        "no_padding_bottom": false,
        "color_scheme": "custom",
        "color_bg": "#f5f5f5",
